    "Experimental. DavidNook runs in the App Sandbox, so whether ⌘V can be sent depends on macOS accepting it after you grant permission; this has not been verified on every macOS version. Without permission the item is only copied back to the clipboard." : {
      "comment" : "Clipboard settings footer for auto-paste.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Experimental. DavidNook runs in the App Sandbox, so whether ⌘V can be sent depends on macOS accepting it after you grant permission; this has not been verified on every macOS version. Without permission the item is only copied back to the clipboard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "實驗性功能。DavidNook 在 App 沙盒內執行，能否送出 ⌘V 取決於授權後 macOS 是否接受，尚未在所有 macOS 版本驗證。未授權時，項目只會被放回剪貼簿。"
